## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double ema6 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,6,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema23 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,23,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_H1,30,60,30,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)` (non-std periods)
- `double stoch_m = iStochastic(NULL,PERIOD_H1,5,3,3,MODE_SMA,0,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- `double stoch_s = iStochastic(NULL,PERIOD_H1,5,3,3,MODE_SMA,0,MODE_SIGNAL,1)`
- LONG: cross_up(ema6,ema23) AND macd > 0 AND stoch_m > stoch_s
- SL: 25 pips; TP: 55 pips
- P3 sweeps: EMA (5/20 vs 6/23), MACD (12,26,9 vs 30,60,30), SL/TP (20-30/50-60)

